NODE id=github.com/paxlabs-inc/layerx/internal/deposit.maxBlockRange kind=const
  digest=b3:14d6c751bc7eed0b605e3301a0bb7857c2ba4151115d3facbd66d431b922552f file=layerx/internal/deposit/deposit.go range=25:29 lang=go exported=false byte_range=768:1118
  sig=uint64
  doc=maxBlockRange bounds a single FilterLogs span so a large backlog is scanned in\nchunks (RPC providers cap log-range queries). The Paxeer chain-125 RPC\n(https://api.hyperpax.xyz) caps eth_getLogs at 2000 blocks per query, so a\nchunk spans exactly that many blocks ([start, start+2000-1] inclusive = 2000).
EDGES
